{
  "permissions": {
    "disableBypassPermissionsMode": "disable",
    "ask": [
      "Bash(git push *)",
      "Bash(gh pr create *)",
      "Edit(./.github/**)",
      "Edit(./.claude/settings.json)",
      "Edit(./scripts/hooks/**)",
      "Edit(./scripts/lib/**)",
      "Edit(./CODEOWNERS)",
      "Edit(./infra/**)",
      "Edit(./deploy/**)",
      "Edit(./cdk/**)",
      "Edit(./terraform/**)",
      "Edit(./src/content/scripture/translations.ts)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(gh pr merge:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr review:*)",
      "Bash(gh release create:*)",
      "Bash(gh release delete:*)",
      "Bash(gh workflow run:*)",
      "Bash(gh workflow enable:*)",
      "Bash(gh workflow disable:*)",
      "Bash(gh api --method PUT:*)",
      "Bash(gh api --method POST:*)",
      "Bash(gh api --method PATCH:*)",
      "Bash(gh api --method DELETE:*)",
      "Bash(gh api -X PUT:*)",
      "Bash(gh api -X POST:*)",
      "Bash(gh api -X PATCH:*)",
      "Bash(gh api -X DELETE:*)",
      "Bash(gh secret set:*)",
      "Bash(gh secret delete:*)",
      "Bash(gh variable set:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo delete:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push -f:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard:*)",
      "Bash(git clean -fdx:*)",
      "Bash(git update-ref:*)",
      "Bash(git filter-branch:*)",
      "Bash(npm publish:*)",
      "Bash(aws s3 sync:*)",
      "Bash(aws s3 rm:*)",
      "Bash(aws cloudfront create-invalidation:*)",
      "Bash(cdk deploy:*)",
      "Bash(terraform apply:*)",
      "Bash(terraform destroy:*)",
      "Read(./.env)",
      "Read(./.env.*)",
      "Read(./**/*.pem)",
      "Read(./**/*.key)",
      "Read(./**/.aws/**)"
    ]
  },
  "_comment": "Sensitive-path Edit rules are ASK (a human approving the prompt IS the approval; commits then need a SECURITY-REVIEW trailer via scripts/hooks/commit-msg). Deny rules are absolute. The translation registry is guarded because enabling Scripture text display is an editorial decision. Deploys (Pages, S3/CloudFront) are human-only. See AGENTS.md.",
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/guard-destructive-commands.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
